  "description": "On the outside, Gwon Chang-Jun might seem like a pious, church-going man, but that is far from reality! He's sleazy, creepy, and a total scumbag! But karma soon comes for him in the form of a swift bash on the head, transporting him to a world of romance fantasy! He's told that the only way home is for him to satisfy the local god, but this guy's desires are quite...unusual. When the church said \"thy will be done,\" this isn't quite what Chang-Jun imagined!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Erofan Short Story Collection (에~로판 단편선) or the Steamy Collection in english.*",
